# DB_PASSWORD, DB_USER, DB_HOST, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, and SEC_EDGAR_USER_AGENT
# are NOT set via .env — forecaster/credentials.py reads them directly from
# the shared C:\Users\james\GitHub\Secrets folder (postgres.py, Anthropic.py,
# SEC.py) at runtime. This file only documents optional non-secret overrides;
# set these as real OS environment variables if you need to change a default,
# not in a .env file (none is loaded).

# PostgreSQL — non-secret overrides (defaults shown)
# DB_PORT=5432
# DB_NAME=investment_forecaster
# PORTFOLIO_DB_NAME=investment_portfolio

# IBKR Client Portal Gateway (primary market data source)
# Leave as default if running on the same machine as TWS / Client Portal Gateway.
# IBKR_GATEWAY_URL=https://localhost:5000
